Because the current revision of the spoiler file (v5.35) is approximately
250k in size, it doesn't get posted to the net very often.  Basically we
wait until we have a new revision (the old one has only been out since
February).  We are currently working on a new revision (currently at v6.01),
as well as a replacement for the 'data' file on nethack, which will give
complete information, including descriptions, of every monster in the game,
as well as references to AD&D manuals where applicable.  Release date for
either:  unknown.

As for where to get the spoilers - approximately every two weeks I post
a file telling where you can get them - not just via ftp, either.  It
tells where to get them via ftp, uucp, or e-mail.  See my next post (which
is the information post) for details...

